n for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design automation"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Geometry generation"},{"text":"BIM automation"},{"text":"Simulation workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"C#"},{"type":"p","text":"C# becomes useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grasshopper scripting"},{"text":"Rhino development"},{"text":"Custom components"},{"text":"Geometry processing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong long-term profile can be:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grasshopper"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"C#"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"RhinoCommon"}]}]},{"heading":"Major Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Parametric Façade"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a façade system controlled by:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building width"},{"text":"Building height"},{"text":"Panel size"},{"text":"Opening ratio"},{"text":"Solar orientation"},{"text":"Shading depth"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Orientation","Solar Exposure","Panel Rotation","Shading Geometry","Façade"]},{"type":"p","text":"Demonstrate how changing parameters automatically updates the façade."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Parametric Pavilion"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a pavilion where:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Height"},{"text":"Span"},{"text":"Number of ribs"},{"text":"Curvature"},{"text":"Opening size"},{"text":"are controlled parametrically."}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grasshopper definition"},{"text":"Generated variations"},{"text":"Final model"},{"text":"Structural considerations"},{"text":"Fabrication drawings"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Environmental Optimization"},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Grasshopper + Ladybug/Honeybee"},{"type":"p","text":"Optimize:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Solar exposure"},{"text":"Daylight"},{"text":"Thermal comfort"},{"text":"Window size"},{"text":"Building orientation"},{"text":"Shading"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["100+ Design Variations","Environmental Simulation","Performance Metrics","Optimization","Top-performing Designs"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Generative Housing Layout"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an algorithm that generates multiple housing layouts based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plot dimensions"},{"text":"Setbacks"},{"text":"Unit area"},{"text":"Circulation"},{"text":"Daylight requirements"},{"text":"Open-space requirements"},{"text":"This demonstrates that parametric design can solve real planning problems, rather than merely generating visually complex forms."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Parametric Urban Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a computational model for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Building massing"},{"text":"Street network"},{"text":"Density"},{"text":"Open space"},{"text":"Solar access"},{"text":"Walkability"},{"text":"Analyse multiple urban configurations."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Digital Fabrication"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a parametric structure and manufacture it using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CNC"},{"text":"Laser cutting"},{"text":"3D printing"},{"text":"Robotic fabrication"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Grasshopper","Digital Geometry","Fabrication Logic","CNC / Laser / Robot","Physical Prototype"]}]},{"heading":"Internship Roadmap","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1–2"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Architecture firms"},{"text":"Digital design studios"},{"text":"Computational architecture studios"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"3D modelling"},{"text":"Basic Grasshopper"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2–3"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computational design studios"},{"text":"Façade engineering firms"},{"text":"Digital fabrication companies"},{"text":"Advanced architecture practices"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Work on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parametric systems"},{"text":"Façade design"},{"text":"Geometry generation"},{"text":"Environmental analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3–4"},{"type":"p","text":"Target specialized positions:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Computational Design Intern"},{"text":"Parametric Design Intern"},{"text":"Digital Design Intern"},{"text":"Computational Architecture Intern"},{"text":"BIM Automation Intern"},{"text":"Digital Fabrication Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest internship is one where the student contributes to a real computational workflow, rather than simply producing Grasshopper screenshots."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Job Titles","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Parametric Designer"},{"text":"Computational Designer"},{"text":"Computational Design Architect"},{"text":"Computational Design Assistant"},{"text":"Digital Designer"},{"text":"Architectural Computational Designer"},{"text":"Generative Design Specialist"},{"text":"Digital Design Specialist"},{"text":"BIM Computational Designer"},{"text":"Design Technology Specialist"},{"text":"Computational Façade Designer"},{"text":"Digital Fabrication Designer"},{"text":"Architectural Technologist"},{"text":"Computational Design Research Assistant"}]}]},{"heading":"Employer Skill Matrix","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Important Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Architecture Practice"},{"text":"Rhino + Grasshopper + design"}],[{"text":"Computational Design Studio"},{"text":"Advanced Grasshopper + scripting"}],[{"text":"Façade Consultancy"},{"text":"Geometry + optimization"}],[{"text":"Engineering Consultancy"},{"text":"Parametric + structural concepts"}],[{"text":"BIM Consultancy"},{"text":"Revit + Dynamo + scripting"}],[{"text":"Digital Fabrication Studio"},{"text":"Geometry + fabrication"}],[{"text":"Construction Technology Fir